## 2. Combining Multiple Media Features in a single Media Query.

### 2.1 Logical Operators

#### 2.1.1 And

1. Using `and` operator can combine multiple Media Features.

*Syntax :*
`@media (media-feature-expression) and (media-feature-expression) {
    /* CSS rules go here */ 
}`

2. We can also join media feature with a media type.

*Syntax :*
`@media media-type and (media-feature-expression) {
    /* CSS rules go here */ 
}`

<WebCodePlayground>
```html
